WEBVTT

00:03:58.484 --> 00:04:00.820
But actually, there's something
much bigger here

00:04:00.861 --> 00:04:02.655
than student grades.

00:04:02.697 --> 00:04:05.324
Education goes beyond economic growth,

00:04:05.324 --> 00:04:07.660
and our goal goes beyond the classroom.

00:04:08.035 --> 00:04:10.496
Schools are a funnel to the real world.

00:04:11.122 --> 00:04:13.249
Public education makes citizens.

00:04:13.624 --> 00:04:16.627
And in creating
the next generation of citizens,

00:04:16.627 --> 00:04:19.338
we cannot be leaving behind
four out of five children

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:20.548
or their families.

00:04:21.048 --> 00:04:25.886
If we continue to pick and choose
who the system engages with

00:04:25.928 --> 00:04:29.807
generation after generation,
like we do now,

00:04:29.807 --> 00:04:33.811
we will not be left
with a community, a civil society